$DATUM A suspension of the above intermediate (0.535 g, 1.63 mmol), compound 15
(0.826 g, 1.65 mmol), Pd(PPh3)2Cl2 (0.116 g, 0.16 mmol), K2CO3 (0.342. g,
1.48 mmol) in DMF (66 mL) and water (8 mL) was heated to 100 °C for 4 h.
The reaction mixture was concentrated. The residue was partitioned
between EtOAc and water. The aqueous layer was extracted with EtOAc. The
combined organic layers were washed with brine, dried over Na2SO4, and
concentrated to crude product. The crude product was loaded onto a plug
of silica gel and eluted (50-100% EtOAc/hexanes). 0.741 g (78%) of a
yellow solid. LC-MS(ESI): m/z 574.2 (M + H)+.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Suzuki-Miyaura cross-coupling reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Structure-Guided Design of a Series of MCL-1 Inhibitors with High
Affinity and Selectivity
